1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:17,333
Welcome to TrustGate — the Concordium gateway where autonomous AI agents meet real accountability, micro-payments, and verifiable trust. Let us launch the control plane.

2
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:37,333
On the Live Monitor, an authorized AI agent requests premium financial telemetry. TrustGate intercepts the request, returning an HTTP 402 challenge. The agent settles 0.002 CCD instantly, and access is granted.

3
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:49,333
Next, an unverified autonomous bot tries scraping private endpoints. With no Concordium identity, TrustGate blocks it cold with an HTTP 403 Forbidden. Safe, enforced, automatic.

4
00:00:50,500 --> 00:01:03,333
Inspect the protocol wire playground. Here developers can simulate exact HTTP headers: 200 OK with settlement proofs, 402 Payment Required with Concordium contract addresses, and 403 Forbidden violations.

5
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:15,333
Welcome to the Agent Registry. Under Concordium's CIS-8004 standard, every AI agent is minted as an on-chain identity, permanently bound to a verified human owner.

6
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:25,333
Through the CIS-8 standard, external execution keys on Base EVM are cryptographically mapped to the Concordium identity layer. Cross-chain execution, unified accountability.

7
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:39,333
Our live on-chain badge inspector allows any web service to embed real-time verification. Test a legitimate agent against a rogue impostor with instant visual and cryptographic validation.

8
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:53,333
The Audit Log enforces strict compliance with Article 12 of the EU AI Act. Every inference, transaction, and payment creates an immutable, tamper-proof record.

9
00:01:54,500 --> 00:02:09,333
Click any audit record to generate an official statutory decree of compliance, complete with legal seal, cryptographic hashes, and exportable regulatory documentation.

10
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:29,333
Developers integrate TrustGate in under five minutes using our published npm package: @0xskinny001/trustgate-sdk. Just three lines of code protect any Next.js API or Model Context Protocol server.

11
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:41,333
TrustGate: Verified. Monetized. Accountable. Powered by Concordium. Try the live demo, inspect the contracts on CCDScan, or install the SDK today.
